        },
        {
          "text": " Naomi yaagira omukaamwana ati: Ogwo mushaija aheebwe omugisha ahari MUKAMA, otarekire kugirira mbabazi abakiriho na baanyakufa. Naomi yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Ogwo mushaija ni mwene waitu ow'obuzaare bwa haihi, omwe ah'abashemereire kutucungura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruusi Omumoabukazi yaamugira ati: N'ekya buzima yangira ati: Ogume haihi n'abairu bangye, okuhitsya obu baraaheze kugyesha emisiri yangye yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi yaagira Ruusi omukaamwana ati: Mwana wangye, ni kirungi ogume ogyende n'abazaana be, barekye kukushanga omu gundi musiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga obwo yaaguma haihi n'abazaana ba Boazi, naahumba okuhitsya aha muheru gw'eishaaruura rya sayiri n'engano; kandi yaaguma na nyinazaara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.23",
